<<
/Type /StructElem
/S /P
/E (Imagine the AI only learnt how to code by looking at all the publicly available codebases on the internet and the accessible documentation. If you try to use some obscure framework that was developed yesterday with zero publicly available documentation then you will have a very bad time vibe coding.)
/Pg 41 0 R
